# This deployment must only ever serve the compiled artifact - never the
# source. outputDirectory is "." in vercel.json (there's nothing to
# build; ProcureSherpa-v2.0.html is already the committed release
# artifact), which means anything NOT excluded here becomes a directly
# fetchable static file. Whitelist by exclusion: everything is ignored
# except the handful of files actually meant to be served.
*
!ProcureSherpa-v2.0.html
!robots.txt
!sitemap.xml
!vercel.json
